                       "id":  1,
                       "type":  "text",
                       "options":  {
                                       "content":  "Search and filter the lineage catalog with the variables above (metric name, display name, family, data source, source API). Column filters on the table also work.\r\n\r\n**Lineage fields:** metric name, source API, Grafana data source (mimir / loki / tempo), origin file, series family (Prometheus series or simulated store — not a SQL table in this lab), labels/tags, related log event, span name.\r\n\r\n**Drill-down:** pick a metric, then use live series, related logs, and related traces. Click TraceID on a log line to open Tempo. KPI panels on other tabs have a **Lineage** panel link.\r\n\r\nJSON search API: `GET /api/observability/catalog?q=timeout`",
                                       "code":  {
                                                    "showMiniMap":  false,
                                                    "language":  "markdown",
                                                    "showLineNumbers":  false
                                                },
                                       "mode":  "markdown"
                                   }
                   },
